sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant N as NGINX
    participant B as Backend
    participant L as Access log (shared volume)
    participant SH as lb-otel-shipper
    participant OC as OTel Collector
    participant TS as Telemetry Service
    participant T as TimescaleDB
    participant E as Engine
    participant R as Redis
    participant S as Routing Sidecar

    rect rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.08)
    Note over C,L: Data plane (per request, < 5 ms overhead)
    C->>N: HTTP request
    N->>B: forward
    B-->>N: response
    N-->>C: response
    N--)L: append JSON access log line
    end

    rect rgba(4, 120, 87, 0.08)
    Note over L,T: Telemetry pipeline (off the request path, fire-and-forget)
    L--)SH: tail
    SH--)OC: OTLP/HTTP-JSON (per request)
    OC--)TS: forward
    TS--)T: METRICS_INSERT
    end

    rect rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.08)
    Note over T,S: Control plane (engine cycle, every 5-60 s)
    E->>T: query metrics
    T-->>E: snapshot
    E->>R: publish event
    R->>S: deliver
    S->>N: regenerate nginx.conf + reload
    end
